**/scratch*/**

# Build artifacts (rebuilt inside container in standalone mode)
node_modules
coverage
**/coverage
ctrf
**/ctrf
**/.cache
data
uploads

# Large testsuites & validation artifacts not needed in builds
testsuite
**/testsuite
languages/modelica/testsuite
